    },
    "regime_notes": "Full-history daily paper IC and ICIR pass the benchmark gates (absolute IC >= 0.0070 and absolute ICIR >= 0.0840), but recent 120/260/520-observation ICIR is below the gate; use capped exposure and monitor drift. Small cross-asset cross-section is handled with an 8-instrument minimum.",
